  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-of-god-lebano.the-cedars-of-god-lebanon-s-sacred-cedar-forest": "上主的香柏林：黎巴嫩的神圣香柏树林",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-of-god-lebano.the-cedars-of-god-arz-el-rab-is-lebanon-s-oldest-cedar-grove": "上主的香柏林（Arz el-Rab）是黎巴嫩最古老的香柏树林，位于布沙里上方的马克梅尔山，海拔约1,900至2,050米。黎巴嫩香柏树在圣经中被提及103次。林地与下方卡迪沙谷于1998年一同列入联合国教科文组织世界遗产。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-of-god-lebano.the-qadisha-valley": "卡迪沙谷",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-of-god-lebano.bekaa-kafra": "贝卡卡夫拉",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-of-god-lebano.plan-a-pilgrimage": "规划朝圣之旅",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.what-the-cedars-of-god-a.what-the-cedars-of-god-are": "上主的香柏林是什么",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.what-the-cedars-of-god-a.arz-el-rab-means-cedars-of-the-lord-the-grove-stands-on-moun": "Arz el-Rab意为“上主的香柏林”。林地位于黎巴嫩北部布沙里村以东的马克梅尔山，海拔1,900至2,050米。联合国教科文组织称其为黎巴嫩古代森林最后的遗存，也是黎巴嫩香柏树（",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.what-the-cedars-of-god-a.cedrus-libani": "Cedrus libani",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.what-the-cedars-of-god-a.still-grows": "）仍生长的少数地点之一。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.what-the-cedars-of-god-a.some-of-the-trees-here-are-more-than-30-meters-tall-and-abou": "据The National报道，部分树木高逾30米，树龄约2,000年。香柏树位于黎巴嫩国旗中央。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-in-scripture.the-cedars-in-scripture": "圣经中的香柏树",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-in-scripture.the-cedar-of-lebanon-is-cited-103-times-in-the-bible-and-in": "黎巴嫩香柏树在圣经中被提及103次。古代人珍视其木材，用来建造重要宗教建筑。圣咏92篇说，义人将像黎巴嫩香柏树一样生长。对黎巴嫩基督徒而言，林地是神圣之所，古树则是与圣经之地有生命的联系。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.a-forest-the-church-prot.a-forest-the-church-protects": "教会守护的森林",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.a-forest-the-church-prot.the-maronite-church-has-long-protected-the-grove-a-small-cha": "马龙尼教会长期保护林地。林中有一座小堂，每年举行一台弥撒，纪念香柏树。美联社于2023年报道了一次主显圣容庆日聚会，在林中一座19世纪中叶的小堂举行。马龙尼宗主教贝沙拉·伯多禄·拉伊讲道，人们以阿拉伯语和阿拉美语唱圣歌。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.a-forest-the-church-prot.the-church-keeps-strict-rules-to-protect-the-forest-and-keep": "教会实行严格规则，保护森林，避免在林中兴建建筑。摊亭、旅游商店与大型停车场都设在远离树木的地方。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.the-cedars-the-qadisha-valley-and-saint-charbel": "上主的香柏林、卡迪沙谷与圣夏尔贝勒",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.the-cedars-overlook-the": "上主的香柏林俯瞰",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.qadisha-valley": "卡迪沙谷",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.the-holy-valley-where-maronite-monks-and-hermits-took-refuge": "，即“圣谷”，马龙尼修士与隐修士数百年来曾在此避难。联合国教科文组织将山谷和香柏林列为同一处世界遗产。谷壁中坐落着",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.qannoubine": "坎努宾",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.and": "与",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.qozhaya": "科扎亚",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.text": ".",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.the-cedars-are-in-the-same-mountains-as": "的修道院。上主的香柏林与",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.bekaa-kafra": "贝卡卡夫拉",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.the-village-where-saint-charbel-was-born-in-1828-and-our": "处于同一山地区域，该村是圣夏尔贝勒于1828年的出生地。我们的",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.pilgrimage-guide": "朝圣指南",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.the-cedars-the-qadisha-v.places-the-grove-about-a-20-minute-drive-from-the-village-pi": "将林地列为距村庄约20分钟车程的地点。朝圣者常在一周的夏尔贝勒行程中加入布沙里与上主的香柏林。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.caring-for-the-cedars.caring-for-the-cedars": "照料香柏树",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.caring-for-the-cedars.the-long-term-survival-of-the-forest-is-in-doubt-as-temperat": "随着气温上升，森林能否长久存续受到质疑。当地环保人士于2023年告诉美联社，较暖天气导致以香柏树皮为食的害虫群体扩大。布沙里一个环保团体多年来在更高海拔种植约200,000棵香柏树，其中约180,000棵存活。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.visiting-the-cedars.visiting-the-cedars": "探访上主的香柏林",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.visiting-the-cedars.bsharri-is-the-nearest-town-and-the-usual-base-for-the-cedar": "布沙里是最近的城镇，也是探访上主的香柏林与卡迪沙谷上段的常用落脚点。春季至秋季最佳；冬雪可能封闭通往林地的道路，正如我们的",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.visiting-the-cedars.pilgrimage-guide": "朝圣指南",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.visiting-the-cedars.notes-check-conditions-with-local-hosts-before-you-drive-up": "所提醒。驾车上山前，请向当地接待者确认路况。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.visiting-the-cedars.the-grove-is-a-protected-forest-and-a-place-of-prayer-for-ma": "林地是受保护的森林，也是许多访客的祈祷之所。请安静步行，不离开小径，保持树木原貌。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.frequently-asked-questions": "常见问题",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.what-are-the-cedars-of-god": "上主的香柏林是什么？",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.the-last-great-grove-of-ancient-lebanon-cedars-on-mount-makm": "黎巴嫩北部布沙里上方马克梅尔山，古老黎巴嫩香柏树最后的大林地。阿拉伯语称Arz el-Rab，意为“上主的香柏林”。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.how-high-is-the-cedars-of-god-forest": "上主的香柏林海拔多高？",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.unesco-places-it-between-1-900-and-2-050-meters-above-sea-le": "联合国教科文组织将其位置列为布沙里村以东，海拔1,900至2,050米。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.how-old-are-the-cedars": "香柏树有多古老？",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.some-of-the-trees-are-reported-to-be-more-than-30-meters-tal": "据报道，部分树木高逾30米，树龄约2,000年。不同来源的数量和树龄不尽相同，请将它们视为估计。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.why-are-the-cedars-sacred": "为何香柏树是神圣的？",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.the-lebanon-cedar-is-named-103-times-in-the-bible-and-the-ma": "黎巴嫩香柏树在圣经中被提及103次。马龙尼教会保护这片林地，林中有小堂，每年举行弥撒，纪念树木。",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.is-the-cedars-of-god-a-unesco-world-heritage-site": "上主的香柏林是联合国教科文组织世界遗产吗？",
  "cedars-of-god-lebanon.frequently-asked-questio.yes-unesco-inscribed-the-qadisha-valley-and-the-forest-of-th": "是。1998年，教科文组织将卡迪沙谷与上主的香柏林共同列为同一处遗产。",
